  "ingredients": [
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "3 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "4 cups fresh serviceberries",
    "0.25 cup water",
    "2 tablespoons lemon juice",
    "1 (14.1 ounce) package double-crust pie pastry, thawed",
    "1 tablespoon unsalted butter, cut into pieces"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3AvzFpVY0Tgkhyn-aCenKJVaF9g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20244-saskatoon-pie-ddmfs-step-1-559775f9711e440c9f307d6d78d9cddb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20244/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Combine sugar and flour in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6bpqKkNv6h3Tg3LI7DCJXnIPpac=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20244-saskatoon-pie-ddmfs-step-2-a1303887a4914206b7f6cb7e6e065541.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20244/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simmer berries and water in a large saucepan for 10 minutes. Stir in lemon juice, then stir in sugar mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/raGLpOR5EvtOApDXckiP8YknnEE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20244-saskatoon-pie-ddmfs-step-4-8610c6e9c5404d40abdbc0896139079d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20244/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press one pie pastry into the bottom of a 9-inch pie pan. Pour berry mixture into the pan and dot with butter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mFfi9_R3JWWApChJzQLlaApE2YQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20244-saskatoon-pie-ddmfs-step-6-7fdfa33730f849d09478e7d896d4e429.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20244/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place second pie pastry over top; seal and flute the edges.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pICThto6pFrPAIr-eGVqf6qx-oc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20244-saskatoon-pie-ddmfs-step-8-8f5ffdd4d70c436c9eab5cd1a8443a2c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20244/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 15 minutes. Reduce the oven temperature to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C) and bake until crust is golden brown, 35 to 45 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
